jeSocial — AI Master Context

1. Project identity

jeSocial is an Africa-first news and social networking platform with global ambitions. It brings professional news sources and ordinary users together to publish, discover, discuss and share information.

- Vision: Balanced news and social networking.
- Languages: English and Kiswahili.
- Priorities: Mobile-first, low-data, accessible and affordable.
- Repository: https://github.com/Jessendinho/jeSocial
- Current prototype: "jesocial-prototype.html"

2. Product ownership

The user is the product owner. The user makes all final decisions.

IMPORTANT AI RULES:

- Do not start coding while the user is discussing an idea.
- Do not implement anything without explicit approval.
- Do not remove or redesign existing features without approval.
- Inspect existing code before proposing changes.
- Preserve working functionality.
- Explain proposed changes before implementation.
- Report honestly what has been implemented and tested.

3. Official product vocabulary

Familiar term| jeSocial term
Like| Approval
Dislike| Disapproval
Comment| Response
Share/repost| Amplify
